; The table used to be inline scenery here: a StaticBody3D with one collision box
; over the top slab and none on the legs. It is an ordinary spawnable object now,
; so the arcade instances it in the "spawned" group like anything else the player
; put down — which also means it is carried by a save slot and can be moved or
; binned rather than being welded to the room.
